  "dimensions": [],
  "description": "Both legs of the L run floor to ceiling, 582 inside along the back wall (618 deep) and 582 along the left wall, one space round the corner. Doors 2437 high, 18 thick: 558 wide on the back-wall leg, 576 wide on the left-wall leg (it covers the corner). Bench shortened to 2638, from x = 1200, 330 deep. Inside, within its 18 boards (rear panels against the walls included): 1164 × 582 along the back wall and 582 × 582 along the left wall, 2407 high. Above the bench: a 75\" TV (1680 × 960), centred on the 2638 of clear wall, from 1100 to 2060. 250-deep shelves right across, 2638 long, below it at 1000 and above it at 2210. A middle shelf at 1550 either side, 329 long, 150 clear of the TV. A dresser on the front wall between the sink and the desk (x 823-2193): 1370 wide overall (its body 1330), 1940 high, 410 deep up to 830 (two drawers over two doors, under a wooden top), then 340 deep with three open shelves.From plan3/room_3d.html",
